   132	  and `run_id` are present and differ, the first wins; an id whose tail is
   133	  too long is bound by its prefix instead of being rejected. When a
   134	  mismatch is NOT blocked (advisory mode, or a heuristic bind) the notice
   135	  names the CURRENT call's manifest as "the recorded call", and once that
